      <activity id="8de684d2-c0a3-57ea-a3ef-1332839e9175" activityNameId="02c81766-46f3-57a3-9321-e30a3c2fa46b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Asphalt concrete (AC) 22 EME C1, 40% recycling, high temperature, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Asphalt concrete (AC) 22 EME C1, 40% recycling, high temperature, at plant
Modern Swiss technologies for regional storage facilities, material extraction, and asphalt production. Based on survey data from 73 asphalt mixing plants. 
UUID: 976d9d4a-4c77-4e94-9e6a-2de942d3ad1d
This dataset covers the production of Asphalt Concrete AC 22 EME C1 in Switzerland, with 40% reclaimed asphalt. It includes raw material extraction, transportation, and manufacturing processes.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Production of hot mix asphalt concrete AC 22 EME C1, using industrial machinery.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 351352456 t 
Sampling: Survey
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_976d9d4a-4c77-4e94-9e6a-2de942d3ad1d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
